The tensor type llama.cpp's Q4_K_M gives each block matrix of Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct, read from the file llama32-Q4_K_M.gguf with llama.cpp's gguf package. Not planned, nothing scored.
Q6_K is 6.5625 bits a weight and Q4_K is 4.5.
